s=\"courseOverview_container__SgWLp courseOverview_course_overview__UPEU0\"><h2 class=\"courseOverview_heading__1vuQ8\">Course Overview</h2><div class=\"courseOverview_right__x9MLc \"><div class=\"courseOverview_content__QcPah courseOverview_clamp__4wTsH\"><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" data-mce-style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" data-mce-style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong>What is GfG 160: </strong>Solve handpicked coding problems daily for the next 160 days and master DSA in a </span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\" data-mce-style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">structured and organized manner. </span><span data-mce-style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">No need for random SDE sheets anymore! </span><span data-mce-style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">Practice topic-wise DSA Problems with this 160 Day roadmap that will help you improve your DSA skills with additional problems and teach you approaches in a structured manner. So for the next 160 days, just solve the problems in the order recommended in this course to enhance your DSA skills. (See the Detailed Course Syllabus PDF below to check out the flow in which problems will be solved). </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" data-mce-style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Recommended for</strong>:&nbsp;<span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline;\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline;\">A</span><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline;\" style=\"font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; white-space-collapse: preserve; vertical-align: baseline;\">nyone looking to prepare for coding interviews, improve their DSA knowledge, or enhance their programming abilities.The additional Career workshops are a bonus for you to learn about the trending tech stacks and their career scopes.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\" data-mce-style=\"line-height: 1.38; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt;\"><br data-mce-bogus=\"1\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">What else you are getting in this:<br></span></p><ul><li dir=\"ltr\" data-mce-style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" data-mce-style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\">160 Handpicked DSA Problems:</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" data-mce-style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\"> Each problem comes with a detailed article and a video explanation for thorough understanding.</span></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" data-mce-style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\"><span data-mce-style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span data-mce-style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" style=\"font-weight: bold; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">90 Bonus Problems:</span><span data-mce-style=\"color: #000000; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; text-decoration: none; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;\" style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\"> Extra practice problems with video solutions which makes a <strong>total of 250 Problems. </strong></span></span></li><li dir=\"ltr\" data-mce-style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong>Completion Certificate:</strong> Receive a certificate upon successfully finishing the course, validating your skills and knowledge in the field.</span><br></li><li dir=\"ltr\" data-mce-style=\"line-height: 1.38;\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\" data-mce-style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: arial, 